2 CONT
2 CONT Bustanai was our ancestor through two distinct lines of descent: through his son Hananai and his son Hisdai, each of whom was independently our ancestor.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Lay head of Jewish community 610-670. Blev högst 80 år.
