2 CONC fesh by Abraham ben Chiya Ha'Nsi in, Printed in Leipzig, 1860, Page 40), "Rabeinu Avraham Bar Chiya HaNasi" (Sefer Yisodei HaTevuna uMigdal HaEmunah, by Rabeinu Avraham Bar Chiya HaNasi), "R' Avraham ben Chiya Hanasi mi'Barcelona"
