2 CONT * About the kidnapping:  [https://he.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%A8%D7%91%D7%A2%D7%AA_%D7%94%D7%A9%D7%91%D7%95%D7%99%D7%99%D7%9D מעשה ארבעת השבויים]
2 CONT * Primary source about him: Sefer ha-Ḳabbalah [http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/vl/ravad/ravad01.pdf ספר הקבלה].
