2 CONT Founder of Talmud study in Cordoba, Spain.
2 CONT
2 CONT Moses was one of the four scholars who went from Sura, the seat of a once flourishing but then declining Talmudic academy, in order to collect contributions for that school. During a voyage from Bari, on the coast of Italy, they w
2 CONC ere captured by the Moorish-Spanish admiral Ibn Rumahis, Moses was taken to Cordova.
