1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Ṣemaḥ Ṣedeq was predeceased by his only son, Palṭoy, who was chief judge of the court (av bet din) of Sura during his father’s gaonate. He was succeeded by Samuel ben Hophni.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marina Rustow
2 CONT
