2 CONT
2 CONT S. Wasserstrom, False Messiahs and false conversion. Samawʾal al-Maghribi in the context of twelfth-century interconfessionalism, in Procs. XXVIII. Deutscher Orientalistentag, Bamberg 26-30 March 2001, forthcoming.
2 CONT
