1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sheshet_Benveniste     Sheshet ben Isaac ben Joseph Benveniste] (lived in the latter half of the twelfth century) was a French Jewish physician and writer. Like Isaac Benveniste, who i
2 CONC s supposed to have been his father, he was styled "Nasi" (prince).  [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sheshet_Benveniste  ''biography continued]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
