2 CONC n%20Joseph%20Benveniste%20&f=false GoogleBooks] >
2 CONT
2 CONT >Sheshet had three sons, all of whom pre deceased him.  … In the absence of sons, Sheshet’s heirs were his two daughters, Mira and Tolsana.  Mira married her cousin Isaac, the son of Sheshet’s brother Benvenist; ….
