2 CONT
2 CONT A contemporary of Nachmanides 1194-1270 (Rabbi Moshe ben Nachman).  Sefer HaChinuch (is ascribed to either R. Aahron Ha-Levi or R. Pinchas Ha-Levi of Barcelona. His predecessor were the Gerondis who were ?....of the descendants of
2 CONC  the Exile from Jerusalem, who lived in Spain? and who claimed descent form the Levite Biblical Prophet Samuel. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He is the ancestor of the Horowitz family, named after the village of Horovice in Bohemia (Czech Republic) where his grandson Joseph descendant settled. Sefer HaChinuch (Book of Education) - one of the basic early works on Jewish 
2 CONC thought that records all the 613 commandments of the Torah and offers reasons for their issuance. The book was simply intended to impart to Jewish youth a knowledge of the Law, and to present in simple form the principles of Judai
2 CONC sm to the unlearned layman 
