2 CONC 211-8998_n145_p322-337.pdf. Could Francisco Martinez Polanco have married twice, one to Ines Garcia de Santa Gaeda (so far there is nobody else in any record with the surname Garcia de Santa Gaeda), and another to a Polanco?
