2 CONT ==Jakob Wyss III==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Jakob Wyss and Magdelene Spörri 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Gender:	Male 
2 CONT * Birth:	1455  
2 CONT * Zurich, Zurich District, Canton of Zurich, Switzerland 
2 CONT * Death:	1475 (20)  Switzerland 
2 CONT * Find A Grave Memorial - https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/135999195/jakob-wyss
2 CONT
2 CONT  Jakob Wyss BIRTH	1475 Zürich, Switzerland DEATH	1535 (aged 59–60) Switzerland BURIAL	 Endingen-Lengnau Jewish Cemetery Endingen, Bezirk Zurzach, Aargau, Switzerland PLOT	Row 13, Grave 88. MEMORIAL ID	135999195 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 0 FLOWERS 11 My relative, Jakob Wyss, was born 1475, in Weisslingen, Zurich. He married Margaret Schenkel (1487-1504), and died 1535, in Baden, Aargau. He is buried in Row 13, Grave 88.
2 CONT
