2 CONT     * Marroquin, Jose Maria, "La Cuidad de Mexico", Volume 2, p. 11, published 1900. Cadena genealogy circa 1212 and thereafter. "In the village of Ocana, ... Sancho Sanchez De La Cadena, "Comendador de Socabos...." ("...Oidor" An
2 CONC dres De La Cadena and Teresa (Suarez) de Figueroa (AKA Mendoza) were parents of Maria De La Cadena. Teresa's father was Lorenzo Suarez de Figueroa...." Maria married Pedro Martinez De Mazuelo, parents in turn of Catalina De La Cad
2 CONC ena. Catalina married Garcia Martinez de Lerma (Ambassador to Rome, June 5, 1475)....). "...Ruy Diaz de Mendoza Velasquez y Cuellar (b. abt. 1525) Granada, Spain, and married Catalina de Salazar de la Cadena (abt. 1545), daughter 
2 CONC of Gonzalo Fernandez de Salazar and Catalina Maluenda de la Cadena. The Figueroa family seat was in the "Palacio de Feria" in Zafra, Badajoz, Spain.
2 CONT
