1 NOTE {geni:about_me} In his testament found here and on page 329, Gonzalo Diez de Lerma, cousin of Alonso de Lerma, husband of Beatriz Soria Maluenda, and Garcia Martinez de Lerma (father of Governor of Santa Marta Garcia de Lerma), ca
2 CONC lls his other brother as Alonso de Lerma Polanco and his nephew Juan de Lerma Polanco http://riubu.ubu.es/bitstream/10259.4/1367/1/0211-8998_n145_p322-337.pdf. Could his father Francisco Martinez Polanco have married twice, one to
2 CONC  Ines Garcia de Santa Gaeda (so far there is nobody else in any record with the surname Garcia de Santa Gaeda), and another to a Polanco? If not, could his grandfather Francisco Martinez de Lerma have married a Polanco?
2 CONT
2 CONT Historian Juan Castellanos on page 1438 and 1449 also refers to Gonzalo Diez de Lerma's cousin Garcia de Lerma, governor of Santa Marta, as Garcia de Lerma Polanco. He also referes to Pedro de Lerma, conquistador of Peru and nephe
2 CONC w of Garcia de Lerma, as Pedro de Lerma Polanco for unknown reasons. https://books.google.se/books?id=mXYbAQAAIAAJ&dq=Pedro+de+lerma+polanco&focus=searchwithinvolume&q=polanco
2 CONT
