1 NAME Francisco /de Santa Cruz/
2 GIVN Francisco
2 _MARNM de Santa Cruz
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1500
2 ADDR
3 CITY Burgos
3 STAE Castile and León
3 CTRY Spain
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1557
2 ADDR
3 CITY Mexico City
3 STAE Mexico City
3 CTRY Mexico
1 OCCU Alcalde ordinario en 1546
1 TITL Conquistador
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Francisco de Santa Cruz arrived to Nueva Espana in 1519 along with Panfilo de Narvaez and became conquistador of Michoacán along with Hernán Cortés. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Francisco de Santa Cruz was mayordomo of Hernan Cortes in his agricultural companies between 1531 and 1534; and then mayordomo of the Marquesado del Valle, in charge of the sugar mills in Tlatenango by 1536.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was regidor of the city of Mexico in 1531, mayor of the city of Mexico in 1546 and judge of Tutelas in 1550. He was married to Isabel de Orduña, daughter of conquistador of Mexico and Governor of Guatemala, Francisco de Orduña 
2 CONC with whom he had 3 sons (who did not marry and left no descendance) and 3 daughters, two of them marrying conquistadors. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://dbe.rah.es/biografias/51341/francisco-de-santa-cruz
2 CONT
2 CONT https://books.google.se/books?id=E-liDwAAQBAJ&pg=PA89&dq=Estefania+de+Velasco+Francisco+Santa+Cruz&hl=en&sa=X&ved=0ahUKEwift7TlotzfAhWihqYKHYfMBrYQ6AEILTAA#v=onepage&q=Estefania%20de%20Velasco%20Francisco%20Santa%20Cruz&f=false Pa
2 CONC g. 75-92
2 CONT
2 CONT https://books.google.se/books?id=E-liDwAAQBAJ&pg=PA89&lpg=PA89&dq=Francisco+de+Santa+Cruz+Polanco+Catalina&source=bl&ots=yvYAEj6hhq&sig=L5T5ZjIxIrKTTlgoMGZejpvZf4M&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwik6p3kuuPeAhVC1SwKHRAeBg44ChDoATAEegQIAhAB#v
2 CONC =onepage&q=Francisco%20de%20Santa%20Cruz%20Polanco%20Catalina&f=false Page 89
2 CONT
2 CONT https://books.google.se/books?id=Pz9NCgAAQBAJ&pg=PA241&lpg=PA241&dq=francisco+de+santa+cruz+catalina+salamanca&source=bl&ots=9oBjQrd2-H&sig=5fL8JWEKS0X7OEWBuFeXdP_MTxA&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjZsoCRoOPeAhVMkiwKHYEEDCcQ6AEwBXoECAAQAQ
2 CONC #v=onepage&q=francisco%20de%20santa%20cruz%20catalina%20salamanca&f=false Page 241
2 CONT
2 CONT His full name was Francisco de Santa Cruz Polanco according to various AGI sources such as http://www.archivesportaleurope.net/ead-display/-/ead/pl/aicode/ES-41091-AGI10/type/fa/id/ES-41091-AGI-UD-1859526/unitid/ES-41091-AGI-UD-18
