2 CONC e 1st and 2nd centuries, disciple of R. Johanan ben Zakkai and colleague of Gamaliel II, whose sister he married (see Imma Shalom), and of Joshua ben Hananiah.He is the sixth most frequently mentioned sage in the Mishnah. [http://
