1 NOTE {geni:about_me} NOTE: the information below pertains to the Jorg Frey’s parents and could be understood more easily on their profiles rather than on Jorg’s....
2 CONT
2 CONT Marti FREY Birth 1521 SWITZERLAND,  Died in SWITZERLAND
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse: Ursula WYSY,   b.  1524, SWITZERLAND
2 CONT
2 CONT Children    
2 CONT
2 CONT * Fridi FREY,   b. 1 Jan 1551 
2 CONT *Jorg FREY,   b. 6 Jan 1553, Knonau, Zurich,SWITZERLAND,  d. 4 Nov 1635, Knonau, Zurich,SWITZERLAND  
2 CONT *Melchoir FREY,   b.   1556
2 CONT ==================================
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.  MARTI1 FREY was born Abt. 1521 in Switzerland, and died 1556 in Switzerland.  He married URSULA WYSY Abt. 1540.  She was born Abt. 1524 in Switzerland, and died Aft. 1556 in Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About MARTI FREY and URSULA WYSY:
2 CONT Marriage: Abt. 1540
2 CONT 	 Children of MARTI FREY and URSULA WYSY are: 	i.	FRIDLI2 FREY, b. 1552. 2.	ii.	JORG FREY, b. January 06, 1553/54, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland; d. November 04, 1635, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland. 	iii.	MELCHIOR FREY, b. 1556, Knona
2 CONC u, Zurich, Switzerland; m. MARGRETH HUBER.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/f/l/e/Joseph-F-Fleetwood/FILE/0006text.txt
