1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Provincial Mayor of the Santa Hermandad. He was the owner of Hato Grande or Villa de Santa Ana until his death in 1718. Hato Grande or Villa de Santa Ana later became San Francisco de Macoris in 1778 when the city 
2 CONC was founded there. By that time those lands where in the hands of the Tejeda and De Jesus families according to historian Manuel Vicente Hernandez Gonzalez
2 CONT
