2 CONT Children    
2 CONT * 1. Gregorius FREY,   b. 29 Aug 1610, ,,,,SWITZERLAND, ,   d. 10 Mar 1686, Wingen,,Sickingen,Lower Alsace (Bas-rhine),FRANCE,  
2 CONT *   2. Jacob FREY,   b. 8 Jan 1611 
2 CONT *   3. Arbogast FREY,   b. 1613 
