2 CONT =========================================
2 CONT
2 CONT Hans Heinrich Frey born 1583 Baregg Knonau Zurich Switzerland died 1634 Baregg Knonau Zurich Switzerland and Anna Hoehn born 1589 Wadenswil Zurich Switzerland died 1632 Knonau Zurich Switzerland were the parents of https://www.gen
2 CONC i.com/people/Gregorious-Gregory-Frey/5202197794320041624?through=6000000003796273463
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  HANS HEINRICH3 FREY (JORG2, MARTI1) was born Abt. 1583 in Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland, and died Bef. 1634 in Kanton Zurich, Switzerland.  He married ANNA HON July 02, 1609 in Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland.  She was born Abt. 158
2 CONC 9 in Wadenswil, Zurich, Switzerland, and died Abt. 1632.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About HANS FREY and ANNA HON:
2 CONT Marriage: July 02, 1609, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland 	
2 CONT Children of HANS FREY and ANNA HON are: 4.	i.	GREGORIUS4 FREY, b. August 29, 1610, Switzerland, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland; d. March 10, 1686/87, Wingen, Alsace, Bas-Rhin, FRANCE. 	ii.	JACOB FREY, b. 1612. 	iii.	ARBOGAST FREY, b.
2 CONC  1613; d. October 26, 1635, Mettmenstetten, Zurich, Switzerland. 	iv.	HEINRICH FREY, b. April 26, 1615, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland. 	v.	THOMAS FREY, b. 1618; d. March 28, 1622, Knonau, Switzerland. 	vi.	ANDREAS FREY, b. 1620; d. 
2 CONC October 1635, Knonau, Zurich, Switzerland. 	vii.	ANNA FREY, b. 1622. 	viii.	ANNA FREY, b. 1625. 	ix.	GEORG FREY, b. 1629. 	x.	HANS FREY, b. 1630. http://familytreemaker.genealogy.com/users/f/l/e/Joseph-F-Fleetwood/FILE/0006text.tx
