1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  JOSE2 URIBE-Y-VERGARA-TOVAR (PEDRO1 URIBE-Y-VERGARA) was born in Wichapan, Mexico F.D., Mexico. He married MARIA DE-LA-CADENA-PACHECO, daughter of ANTONIO DE-LA-CADENA-BULLON and ISABEL PACHECO-DE-CONTRERAS. She w
2 CONC as baptized on January 03, 1611 in Sagrario Metropolitano, Puebla de Zaragoza, Puebla, Mexico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of JOSE URIBE-Y-VERGARA-TOVAR and MARIA DE-LA-CADENA-PACHECO are:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. CAYETANO3 URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. JOSE URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. NICOLAS URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. iv. ANTONIO URIBE-DE-LA-CADENA-VERGARA, b. Wichapan, Mexico F.D., Mexico; d. May 27, 1678, Monterrey, Nuevo Leon, Mexico.
2 CONT
