1 CONC  two documents with twelve pages. A photostat of this document is available at the University of New Mexico's Zimmerman Library in the Southwest Reading Room. Undoubtedly, these documents had been consulted by individuals over the
1 CONC  decades since the publication of Chávez's Origins of New Mexico Families searching for clues to clear up the noted ambiguity. No progress was made until 1996 when Patricia Black Esterley of the New Mexico Genealogical Society pas
